ey  water fresh mint leaves and sweeten it  with a little bit of honey  you can even consume the whole barley  which is packed with fiber and will keep  you fuller for longer you also check out  my body recipes which you can make for  breakfast lunch and dinner lemongrass is  one of the most common herbs used in  Asian cooking thanks to its citrusy  aroma and health benefits it soothes the  stomach and keeping your belly happy and  healthy I've served my lemongrass water  over ice with a handful of fresh mint  leaves a few lime slices some lemon  juice and also sweeten it with a little  bit of honey this is a refreshing drink  which is perfect for the hot weather  plus the aroma of this drink will keep  you calm  finally coconut cucumber cooler one of  the easiest way to keep yourself  hydrated is to simply drink coconut  water in fact it's a much better option  over sports drinks without any added  sugars or artificial flavorings just  drink it on its own or make it fancy by  infusing coconut water with lime juice  lime and some cucumber slices so make  this summer a fit one by consuming these  detox waters plus you'll be pumping  plenty of vitamins and nutrients into  your body that will naturally help  reduce inflammation boost energy cleanse  the liver and promote healthy skin prep  them ahead and bring them out with you  to beat the heat make sure to snap  pictures share and tag me lemon air  which is a favorite in the comments  below do give this video a thumbs up  like this video share this video and do  subscribe to my youtube channel for a  lot more workout videos healthy recipes  and also nutritional tips all the best  and have a great summer

